message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Wazuh SIEM — Deployment, Threat Detection & Security Monitoring"
abstract: >-
  A hands-on deployment of the Wazuh open-source SIEM/XDR platform in a virtual
  lab, demonstrating centralized log collection from Windows and Linux agents,
  custom rules and decoders, file integrity monitoring, system auditing,
  MITRE ATT&CK alert mapping, and PCI DSS compliance reporting, validated by
  simulating attacks and confirming detection.
